WEBVTT

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.560
ano toki umareta no

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.560
あのとき生まれたの

00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:03.560
I'll softly give you my thoughts

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:09.070
watashi no omoi sotto ageru

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:09.070
私の想いそっとあげる

00:00:03.810 --> 00:00:09.070
That were born at that moment

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:14.950
shinjite ite

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:14.950
信じていて

00:00:09.230 --> 00:00:14.950
Please believe in them

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.420
deatta hi kara

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.420
出逢った日から

00:00:25.870 --> 00:00:28.420
Since the day when we met

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.670
hajimete no kimochi megutteru

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.670
初めての気持ち巡ってる

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.670
For the first time, I have these feelings, and they go around

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.680
honto no egao hoshii nante

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.680
ホントの笑顔ほしいなんて

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:37.680
I want your true smile

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:42.560
anata ga oshiete kureta sorao

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:42.560
あなたが教えてくれた空を

00:00:37.850 --> 00:00:42.560
I embrace the sky

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:47.690
dakishimete yume o miru

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:47.690
抱きしめて夢をみる

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:47.690
That you told me about and dream

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.520
tooi keredo・・・

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.520
遠いけれど・・・

00:00:47.940 --> 00:00:49.520
It's faraway, but...

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:54.740
atatakai hikari no kakera

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:54.740
あたたかい光のかけら

00:00:49.980 --> 00:00:54.740
The fragments of warm light

00:00:54.900 --> 00:01:00.530
kizutsuita hane ni inochi o kureta no

00:00:54.900 --> 00:01:00.530
傷ついた羽根に命をくれたの

00:00:54.900 --> 00:01:00.530
Gave life to my wounded wings

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.950
fureta toki umareta

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.950
触れたとき生まれた

00:01:00.870 --> 00:01:03.950
Born at the moment when we touched

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:08.040
tsuyoi watashi no soba ni

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:08.040
強い私のそばに

00:01:04.120 --> 00:01:08.040
Next to me, who is strong

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:13.260
mamoraretai watashi ga nemutte ita no

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:13.260
守られたいわたしが眠っていたの

00:01:08.210 --> 00:01:13.260
The me who wants to be protected was asleep

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:18.260
sou unmei kaerareru ne

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:18.260
そう運命変えられるね

00:01:13.420 --> 00:01:18.260
That's right, destiny can be changed

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:26.310
futari no koi mezamesasete・・・

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:26.310
ふたりの恋目覚めさせて・・・

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:26.310
Let our love awaken...

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:29.900
{last frame of OP}

00:01:46.570 --> 00:01:50.490
After having seen the world outside, have your impressions of this place changed?

00:01:51.070 --> 00:01:52.420
Yes.

00:01:52.420 --> 00:01:57.870
However,  I must simply live here for the rest of my life, just as my mother did.

00:01:58.870 --> 00:02:02.130
I must forget the outside world.

00:02:02.130 --> 00:02:06.240
Forgive my thoughtlessness.

00:02:06.240 --> 00:02:09.930
Don't say that, I'm thankful to you.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:19.150
I am Kuhouin Murasaki.

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:21.600
I have returned...

00:02:21.070 --> 00:02:25.740
Eleventh Episode 「I Think」

00:02:21.600 --> 00:02:23.640
to the Inner Sanctuary.

00:02:29.300 --> 00:02:30.960
I told you.

00:02:30.960 --> 00:02:33.160
It says there's traffic congestion due to an accident.

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:36.380
So we can't avoid the place where the accident was?

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:37.690
Forget it.

00:02:37.690 --> 00:02:39.670
A person without a driver's license wouldn't understand.

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.440
I want a bike license, though.

00:02:42.440 --> 00:02:43.670
Why don't you get one, then?

00:02:46.020 --> 00:02:47.160
How is it?

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:49.300
There's traffic congestion for 30 kilometers.

00:02:49.300 --> 00:02:52.270
We won't be able to move until they clean up the accident.

00:02:52.270 --> 00:02:54.640
How do you know it's 30 kilometers?

00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:57.100
A kind old man measured it.

00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:59.390
That's amazing.

00:02:59.390 --> 00:03:01.060
I guess it's worthy of being a toll service.

00:03:01.060 --> 00:03:02.230
Yeah.

00:03:02.230 --> 00:03:06.280
Well, until the cleanup is done, there's no way we'll be able to go.

00:03:06.560 --> 00:03:09.970
I'm just worried about getting sick.

00:03:10.630 --> 00:03:11.640
Kind of like you want to vomit?

00:03:11.640 --> 00:03:12.850
Yeah, kind of.

00:03:12.850 --> 00:03:14.860
Stuff your face in a plastic bag!

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:15.950
I'll die.

00:03:16.340 --> 00:03:19.790
If you vomit in the car, I'll kill you.

00:03:20.910 --> 00:03:24.140
Does it accumulate more in your hometown, Kazuko?

00:03:24.140 --> 00:03:26.960
It was normal for it to accumulate over two meters.

00:03:27.530 --> 00:03:29.270
That must've been tough.

00:03:29.270 --> 00:03:31.050
It happens every year,

00:03:31.050 --> 00:03:34.060
so I just think to myself, it'll pile up again this year.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:36.130
Is that how it is?

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:39.070
You wouldn't be able to live if you didn't think like that.

00:03:40.180 --> 00:03:41.190
I see.

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:45.410
However, there was also freedom there.

00:03:45.960 --> 00:03:47.070
Even more than now?

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:49.180
Perhaps.

00:03:49.600 --> 00:03:52.950
But it's not like I hate it here.

00:03:52.950 --> 00:03:54.990
It might be a bit strict,

00:03:54.990 --> 00:03:58.510
but there are also wonderful things that you can only do here.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:01.960
I see...

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:05.460
You can see that western-style building, right?

00:04:05.460 --> 00:04:08.670
The Inner Sanctuary is much further back, inside one of the Japanese-style houses.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:11.440
So the household is that big...

00:04:12.150 --> 00:04:14.180
You can still turn back now.

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:16.500
I'm going.

00:04:16.500 --> 00:04:20.090
It's more of an amazing place than I imagined, but I'll be fine.

00:04:20.090 --> 00:04:22.220
Yayoi and I...

00:04:22.220 --> 00:04:24.560
We might not have the time to protect you.

00:04:24.560 --> 00:04:26.230
I'd do it even if I was alone.

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:28.690
Let's go now.

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:32.800
I want to take Murasaki out of there right away.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:38.340
So we can get in from here?

00:04:38.340 --> 00:04:40.980
There's no other way to get in.

00:04:42.250 --> 00:04:43.080
Benika-sama.

00:04:43.410 --> 00:04:44.250
What?

00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.880
There are traces of someone having used the boat

00:04:46.880 --> 00:04:49.240
after we took Murasaki-san out.

00:04:49.240 --> 00:04:50.890
Ah, that was me.

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:52.550
By yourself?

00:04:52.550 --> 00:04:53.510
Well, yeah.

00:04:53.960 --> 00:04:55.960
I had some business before.

00:04:55.960 --> 00:04:58.470
Will we be okay this time too, then?

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:01.020
Who knows?

00:05:14.150 --> 00:05:15.780
They totally found us!

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:19.480
That's why I wasn't in a confident pose.

00:05:19.480 --> 00:05:21.190
What should we do?

00:05:21.190 --> 00:05:24.500
We can't go through the front now that we've been found.

00:05:24.500 --> 00:05:25.330
That's true, but...

00:05:25.820 --> 00:05:30.180
This place is big, meaning that it'll be hard to find us too.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.650
It's freezing.

00:05:37.690 --> 00:05:41.580
Murasaki probably still longs for the outside world.

00:05:41.580 --> 00:05:43.450
Saying that is...

00:05:43.450 --> 00:05:45.620
I am different from my father.

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:50.280
Being born as a Kuhouin woman, there is a role that she must fulfill.

00:05:50.280 --> 00:05:53.280
I can't understand why he would question that now.

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:58.080
I will be supporting the Kuhouins from now on, and not my father.

00:05:58.080 --> 00:05:59.730
Well said.

00:05:59.730 --> 00:06:03.500
I am happy to have a grandchild like you, Ryuuji.

00:06:05.520 --> 00:06:07.990
But we're up against Juuzawa Benika.

00:06:08.910 --> 00:06:09.960
Where is Lin?

00:06:10.420 --> 00:06:12.650
She went out, taking her subordinates with her.

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:15.960
If she had waited in the Inner Sanctuary, they would have simply come to her.

00:06:15.960 --> 00:06:17.310
That might be true.

00:06:17.310 --> 00:06:20.430
Doesn't she even think that she'll be exhausted, fighting in the cold?

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.270
If she is able to take care of them before that happens, I'm sure they'll leave.

00:06:24.270 --> 00:06:25.900
It's Benika.

00:06:25.900 --> 00:06:27.350
She's dangerous.

00:06:27.350 --> 00:06:31.270
Benika? The woman that once worked here?

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:37.480
This happened when I was 12 and was about to be kidnapped in a hotel.

00:06:37.480 --> 00:06:40.280
The culprit was injured so badly that one would almost feel pity for him.

00:06:40.910 --> 00:06:44.790
He probably would've been happier if she had killed him instead.

00:06:45.220 --> 00:06:47.790
She's just abnormal.

00:06:47.790 --> 00:06:50.300
Lin will not lose.

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.940
I hope so.

00:06:51.940 --> 00:06:54.140
I will go face them too.

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:02.520
Will the lack of fear that comes from naiveté

00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:05.450
serve as an incentive and save that person?

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:30.500
It's her.

00:07:31.140 --> 00:07:32.790
Yayoi-san.

00:07:36.200 --> 00:07:38.740
I thought you wouldn't come.

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:41.010
You're not quite up to par as an opponent, though.

00:07:41.330 --> 00:07:42.720
Oh, is that so?

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:04.090
You just don't learn.

00:08:04.090 --> 00:08:07.280
I'm not used to fighting in cramped places.

00:08:07.280 --> 00:08:10.160
Then the conditions are good today, aren't they?

00:08:10.420 --> 00:08:14.330
Yes, the perfect place to defeat you.

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.840
It'll be a waste of a good woman.

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.850
You're right.

00:08:41.200 --> 00:08:42.430
Benika...

00:08:46.410 --> 00:08:48.910
Lin! Benika is heading towards the Inner Sanctuary!

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:50.340
I'll take care of this one first!

00:08:53.440 --> 00:08:56.190
It's the same. The same movements.

00:08:56.190 --> 00:08:57.030
What is?!

00:08:57.030 --> 00:09:00.050
Benika fights like this, doesn't she?

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:22.780
Are you trying to be like Murasaki?

00:09:23.140 --> 00:09:27.280
As your wife, I won't be punished for doing this once in a while.

00:09:32.330 --> 00:09:34.200
Father!

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:37.170
Benika has brought her pupils.

00:09:37.800 --> 00:09:38.870
I've heard.

00:09:38.870 --> 00:09:40.710
I don't want any more trouble.

00:09:41.210 --> 00:09:44.210
I understand, that's why I'm taking action.

00:09:44.570 --> 00:09:45.820
Is that so?

00:09:45.820 --> 00:09:47.220
Quite admirable.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:51.350
Father, I am not as kind as you are,

00:09:51.350 --> 00:09:52.850
but I do believe I am just.

00:09:54.010 --> 00:09:55.100
Very well.

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:57.730
What is this?

00:09:57.730 --> 00:09:59.480
It's mine.

00:10:09.200 --> 00:10:11.750
Yes, it's good.

00:10:11.750 --> 00:10:13.620
It's good, mother.

00:10:13.890 --> 00:10:15.580
Thank you.

00:10:18.210 --> 00:10:20.010
It's good.

00:10:20.010 --> 00:10:22.080
It's really good.

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:26.550
You actually call me "mother."

00:10:27.170 --> 00:10:31.660
I did not give birth to you, but you are my child.

00:10:31.660 --> 00:10:32.870
Yes.

00:10:32.870 --> 00:10:36.760
You are the one who raised me,

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:39.760
the one who treasured me.

00:10:39.760 --> 00:10:42.440
Murasaki will come to think like that too.

00:10:42.440 --> 00:10:43.310
Do you think so?

00:10:43.980 --> 00:10:48.240
She is probably just scared about being a woman and having to be put in the Inner Sanctuary.

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:49.660
I'm not so sure.

00:10:49.660 --> 00:10:53.740
I didn't think the Inner Sanctuary was like that either.

00:10:53.740 --> 00:10:56.200
It probably would be scary for a seven-year old like her.

00:10:57.610 --> 00:11:00.650
That's right. You'd think so too, right?

00:11:00.650 --> 00:11:05.430
Hey, Ryuuji-san, don't you think it'd be a good idea to make that place more lovely?

00:11:05.430 --> 00:11:10.630
If it becomes a fun place, her ideas of wanting to go outside will disappear.

00:11:10.630 --> 00:11:12.590
Perhaps.

00:11:12.590 --> 00:11:14.220
That may be a good idea.

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:19.310
The woman you'll marry must be happy.

00:11:19.670 --> 00:11:20.930
Probably.

00:11:21.390 --> 00:11:23.330
I believe so too.

00:11:23.730 --> 00:11:25.190
How splendid you are.

00:11:25.980 --> 00:11:29.690
Please wait for me in a warm room, mother.

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:54.800
I'm back.

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:57.160
Please leave, Benika-sama.

00:11:57.160 --> 00:11:58.300
Why?

00:11:58.300 --> 00:12:00.710
You've failed.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:05.370
If I had known it would come to this, I would have never let Murasaki-sama see the outside world.

00:12:05.370 --> 00:12:06.500
Where's Murasaki?

00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:09.610
She greatly regrets her life outside.

00:12:09.610 --> 00:12:13.070
I know a bit of what was wrong.

00:12:13.070 --> 00:12:16.200
But, I believe that she can have much more fun from now on.

00:12:16.200 --> 00:12:17.910
That's what is unnecessary!

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:18.550
Why?

00:12:18.550 --> 00:12:21.660
The outside world has nothing to do with Kuhouin women.

00:12:21.660 --> 00:12:24.660
I came here because that kind of thinking is ridiculous.

00:12:24.930 --> 00:12:28.290
An ill-mannered person like you wouldn't understand

00:12:28.290 --> 00:12:32.710
the beauty, purity, and greatness of being born into this family.

00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:35.770
I don't know, and I don't even want to know.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:39.680
You don't even try to understand how much Murasaki-sama is suffering.

00:12:39.680 --> 00:12:40.930
That's why I came to save her!

00:12:40.930 --> 00:12:42.390
Silence, trash!

00:12:42.390 --> 00:12:44.930
What would a filthy man like you know?

00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.040
How would I know?

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:49.460
I won't question what you've done with Murasaki-sama.

00:12:49.460 --> 00:12:50.440
Benika-sama.

00:12:50.790 --> 00:12:55.090
Please leave this place, so that at the very least she won't have any lingering affections.

00:12:55.090 --> 00:12:58.530
If you won't open it, then I'll go myself.

00:13:01.170 --> 00:13:03.790
Are you saying you must pass?

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:05.870
You can't trust me?

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:07.290
I cannot.

00:13:08.650 --> 00:13:09.500
Liar.

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:20.660
You can't go beyond here!

00:13:20.660 --> 00:13:21.630
Please move.

00:13:21.630 --> 00:13:23.050
Please take this chance to run!

00:13:23.050 --> 00:13:26.020
Someone as young as you is no match for them!

00:13:26.020 --> 00:13:26.950
You'll die!

00:13:26.950 --> 00:13:28.060
I won't.

00:13:28.060 --> 00:13:30.910
You can only say that because you don't know what lies inside.

00:13:30.910 --> 00:13:32.670
I'd still go, even if I knew.

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:35.400
I promised to protect Murasaki.

00:13:35.690 --> 00:13:36.860
Protect?

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:38.160
Yes.

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:52.310
Shinkurou!

00:13:58.970 --> 00:14:00.400
Murasaki!

00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:02.270
This man doesn't learn.

00:14:02.270 --> 00:14:04.350
Could you give up already?

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:09.690
Forgive me, Ryuuji-sama, but this is Souju-sama's final will.

00:14:09.690 --> 00:14:10.840
I don't know about that.

00:14:10.840 --> 00:14:12.920
It's the words your mother left behind.

00:14:12.920 --> 00:14:16.610
Why would you go along with the nonsense of a woman who died holding on to a Hina doll?

00:14:17.020 --> 00:14:21.900
A boy raised in this house wouldn't understand.

00:14:21.900 --> 00:14:25.110
I want to avoid fighting you.

00:14:25.110 --> 00:14:26.870
So, shall we talk?

00:14:27.340 --> 00:14:28.810
No need.

00:14:28.810 --> 00:14:33.060
Murasaki doesn't want to be here. She wants to go outside!

00:14:33.060 --> 00:14:35.420
Isn't that right, Murasaki?

00:14:37.670 --> 00:14:40.580
Murasaki, let's go back to Samidare.

00:14:40.580 --> 00:14:41.670
Tamaki-san and Yamie-san-

00:14:41.670 --> 00:14:43.140
Shinkurou-dono.

00:14:45.500 --> 00:14:48.080
I am a Kuhouin woman.

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:52.060
After having entered the Inner Sanctuary, I can no longer go outside.

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:54.270
Murasaki...

00:14:55.640 --> 00:14:57.860
Kurenai Shinkurou-dono.

00:14:57.860 --> 00:14:59.630
Please leave.

00:15:02.440 --> 00:15:05.100
What are you saying, Murasaki?

00:15:05.100 --> 00:15:06.450
Please leave.

00:15:07.390 --> 00:15:09.490
Murasaki...

00:15:14.180 --> 00:15:15.710
Who are you?

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:18.460
Where's Benika?

00:15:19.040 --> 00:15:21.170
Are you not with the Kuhouins?

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:24.650
I don't care about the Kuhouins and the Inner Sanctuary.

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:27.390
A strong-looking woman went in, right?

00:15:27.390 --> 00:15:29.890
That's what's most important.

00:15:29.890 --> 00:15:33.650
A servant like you cannot lay a foot in the Inner Sanctu-

00:15:36.940 --> 00:15:38.840
I'm fine with being a servant.

00:15:38.840 --> 00:15:41.530
I only came here to fight.

00:15:47.030 --> 00:15:49.740
You're just being made to say that, right?

00:15:49.740 --> 00:15:51.560
It's all right now.

00:15:52.680 --> 00:15:54.370
Shinkurou!

00:16:05.380 --> 00:16:06.700
You!

00:16:07.590 --> 00:16:08.300
Where's Yayoi-san?

00:16:08.300 --> 00:16:10.360
I don't need to answer you.

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.680
Your fates are already decided.

00:16:13.080 --> 00:16:14.020
Where's Yayoi-san?!

00:16:14.020 --> 00:16:15.180
You're getting annoying!

00:16:15.180 --> 00:16:17.120
I'll beat you!

00:16:35.570 --> 00:16:38.760
You taught me how to fight.

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.040
Did you already forget?

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:41.670
Where's the kid who always cried?

00:16:41.670 --> 00:16:45.670
I'm grateful for how strict you were...

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:47.300
Master.

00:16:47.860 --> 00:16:49.110
You...

00:17:01.310 --> 00:17:03.020
I got her!

00:17:05.030 --> 00:17:05.750
So what?!

00:17:20.960 --> 00:17:22.130
Murasaki!

00:17:50.880 --> 00:17:51.510
No!

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:02.460
Run!

00:18:13.610 --> 00:18:15.160
Run!

00:18:20.330 --> 00:18:20.980
Benika!

00:18:40.920 --> 00:18:42.650
Where's Murasaki?

00:18:43.630 --> 00:18:44.420
Where's Murasaki?!

00:18:44.420 --> 00:18:46.520
Just run!

00:18:49.340 --> 00:18:53.420
I do not wish to go outside.

00:18:53.420 --> 00:18:54.610
Please let them-

00:18:54.610 --> 00:18:56.180
Let them run?

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:59.900
Please have them give up.

00:18:59.900 --> 00:19:01.480
I know.

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:04.590
I am not scared.

00:19:04.590 --> 00:19:08.670
I have already accepted this fate.

00:19:08.670 --> 00:19:10.250
Then all is well.

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:14.440
Once you become an adult and accept me,

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:16.820
I won't do anything rough.

00:19:34.760 --> 00:19:36.470
It's freezing.

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:39.050
Benika-san.

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:39.760
What?

00:19:40.910 --> 00:19:45.210
Did you know that person in the kimono?

00:19:45.210 --> 00:19:48.420
She was a maid since Murasaki's mother's time.

00:19:49.040 --> 00:19:52.400
We were able to take Murasaki outside thanks to her.

00:19:52.940 --> 00:19:55.100
I see.

00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:58.610
For her sake, we can't let her death be in vain.

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:02.170
Do you think Yayoi-san is okay?

00:20:02.170 --> 00:20:04.220
I hope she's alive.

00:20:04.770 --> 00:20:06.620
Yeah...

00:20:07.220 --> 00:20:08.460
Shinkurou.

00:20:08.460 --> 00:20:09.850
Yes?

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:13.170
Depending on Yayoi's condition, we may have to give up.

00:20:15.150 --> 00:20:18.090
I can't leave my subordinates to die.

00:20:29.490 --> 00:20:31.800
This place certainly is dark.

00:20:31.800 --> 00:20:33.860
I will go search for those two.

00:20:34.290 --> 00:20:35.210
Lin.

00:20:35.680 --> 00:20:37.860
Kill them within our property.

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:40.010
Isn't that why I'm here?

00:20:43.490 --> 00:20:46.830
I don't know why she's living so happily,

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:48.750
but she's reliable.

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:56.650
I'd like it if you didn't stain the floor with your tears.

00:21:03.490 --> 00:21:07.090
Shinkurou, go back to the car and turn on the engine.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.770
The key is still in the ignition.

00:21:09.770 --> 00:21:11.490
It'll turn on if you turn it.

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:12.780
What about you?

00:21:12.780 --> 00:21:15.490
I'll go back to the car after saving Yayoi.

00:21:15.490 --> 00:21:16.690
By yourself?

00:21:16.690 --> 00:21:18.790
I'll be fine with that many.

00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:20.130
Okay.

00:21:20.130 --> 00:21:22.290
I'll see you later, then.

00:21:22.290 --> 00:21:23.070
Yes.

00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:52.230
Shinkurou.

00:21:59.200 --> 00:22:01.490
Shinkurou...

00:22:22.510 --> 00:22:25.260
He can't be...

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:06.900
sonna ni asette sa nani mo kamo shiritai to omowanaide

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:06.900
そんなに焦ってさ何もかも知りたいと思わないで

00:23:00.640 --> 00:23:06.900
Rushing so much, don't think that you want to know everything.

