kimi no yuku michi no kiseki ni sotto yorisoinagara we can take

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:46.440
君の行く道の軌跡にそっと寄り添いながら we can take

00:23:39.730 --> 00:23:46.440
As we quietly snuggle up to the miracle on your path: we can take

